==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Sneasel}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Sneasel|86}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion; both cards have the {{m|Scratch}} attack.
*{{m|Scratch}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Sneasel}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

